  "summary": {
    "main_findings": [
      "Upper-body push and pull patterns are redundant within each original workout.",
      "Jump squat and jump lunge volumes are too high for power quality given four footvolley sessions and a weekend game.",
      "Lower-body maximal strength, calf and soleus loading, adductors, eccentric hamstrings, landing control and ankle proprioception are underrepresented.",
      "Bodyweight high repetitions emphasize muscular endurance more than maximal force."
    ],
    "priority_change": "Reduce redundant calisthenics volume and reallocate recovery to lower-body strength, low-volume power and joint-tendon capacity."
  },
